 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## On-device article translation
+
+Use the “Read in your language” bar above the news content to select a language and translate article headlines, summaries, bodies, captions, and listing teasers. “Show original” restores the English content and cancels any pending translation. Switching languages always translates from the English original.
+
+This feature uses `window.Translator` in supporting desktop browsers and requires a secure context (HTTPS or localhost). Language-pair support depends on the browser and device. A first translation may download a language pack; progress and failures appear in the translation bar. Article text is processed locally, with no remote translation service. Unsupported browsers keep the original content and show an explanatory message. Translation sessions are released when finished or when navigating between pages.
